      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocky_Point%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The United States Army Corps of Engineers operates the Rocky Point Campground, a year-round public facility for visitors.",
